</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4fa5dbca-9829-11f1-981d-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Screenshot-2026-08-14-234241.png"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4fa5dbca-9829-11f1-981d-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Screenshot-2026-08-14-234241.png" type="image/png" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d206c644-9827-11f1-808a-4de102a14b07</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 21:44:29 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4fa5dbca-9829-11f1-981d-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Screenshot-2026-08-14-234241.png">© 组织者罗珊娜提供</source><dc:creator>华盛顿特约记者 陈米亚</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>火灾中，西班牙救回中世纪君主遗骨和珍贵文物</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260815-%E7%81%AB%E7%81%BE%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E6%95%91%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AA%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%BB%E9%81%97%E9%AA%A8%E5%92%8C%E7%8F%8D%E8%B4%B5%E6%96%87%E7%89%A9</link><description>
